    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/db2d8c6277383609a52df028676d1490.poster.avif?t=1749390773\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/db2d8c6277383609a52df028676d1490.webm?t=1749390773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/da7e80a5e37ec06e554daa67761255ad.avif?t=1749390773\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/c264f940c3f3eac9fa8ec6f5a841898b.poster.avif?t=1749390773\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/c264f940c3f3eac9fa8ec6f5a841898b.webm?t=1749390773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/c264f940c3f3eac9fa8ec6f5a841898b.mp4?t=1749390773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Hear the voice in your head that haunts and tortures you. Follow its commands to the edge of the world. Embrace the darkness in Dark Atlas: Infernum, a first-person horror experience where you must remember who you are, stop the apocalypse, and face your demons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/232ab8c09296cd40bee69906de64af8d.poster.avif?t=1749390773\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/232ab8c09296cd40bee69906de64af8d.webm?t=1749390773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/232ab8c09296cd40bee69906de64af8d.mp4?t=1749390773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/b79107c2a7cfb78aa163115cbd120d7b.avif?t=1749390773\" data-has-big /></div>As Natalia Asensio, Grand Master of an ancient esoteric order, society collapses around you with the appearance of ghosts and the shattering of dimensional barriers. Trapped in a dusty basement, drugged and barely remembering your identity, you must engage in a battle of wills that could open the gates of hell. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/ccaa1b61dfc9380ba4b680c4a5bd48c8.poster.avif?t=1749390773\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/ccaa1b61dfc9380ba4b680c4a5bd48c8.webm?t=1749390773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/ccaa1b61dfc9380ba4b680c4a5bd48c8.mp4?t=1749390773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/cfe889c120a964fbd2b8cdc28e6c37d2.avif?t=1749390773\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/d099c0be13689edc1028e459e71a67d3.poster.avif?t=1749390773\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/d099c0be13689edc1028e459e71a67d3.webm?t=1749390773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/d099c0be13689edc1028e459e71a67d3.mp4?t=1749390773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tPsychological Survival Horror: Navigate intertwining physical and mental realities as you embody Natalia, a leader with deep esoteric knowledge, not a soldier. Be cautious and cunning to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tImmersive Terror: Experience terror in various forms\u2014hide in shadowy corridors, listen for footsteps, watch flickering lights, and analyze every room to stay hidden and safe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tRich Narrative: Engage with a complex and independent story, part of the expansive Radiata Saga transmedia universe, which includes books, podcasts, and more. <br>\u2022\tStunning Artistry: Enjoy meticulously crafted graphics and immersive audio designed to captivate and terrify.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tAccessible for All: Benefit from unique visual and auditory accessibility features, ensuring an enjoyable experience for everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/96811a026b3a7561674402e5f1791462.poster.avif?t=1749390773\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/96811a026b3a7561674402e5f1791462.webm?t=1749390773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/96811a026b3a7561674402e5f1791462.mp4?t=1749390773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/db2d8c6277383609a52df028676d1490.poster.avif?t=1749390773\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/db2d8c6277383609a52df028676d1490.webm?t=1749390773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/da7e80a5e37ec06e554daa67761255ad.avif?t=1749390773\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/c264f940c3f3eac9fa8ec6f5a841898b.poster.avif?t=1749390773\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/c264f940c3f3eac9fa8ec6f5a841898b.webm?t=1749390773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/c264f940c3f3eac9fa8ec6f5a841898b.mp4?t=1749390773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Hear the voice in your head that haunts and tortures you. Follow its commands to the edge of the world. Embrace the darkness in Dark Atlas: Infernum, a first-person horror experience where you must remember who you are, stop the apocalypse, and face your demons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/232ab8c09296cd40bee69906de64af8d.poster.avif?t=1749390773\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/232ab8c09296cd40bee69906de64af8d.webm?t=1749390773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/232ab8c09296cd40bee69906de64af8d.mp4?t=1749390773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/b79107c2a7cfb78aa163115cbd120d7b.avif?t=1749390773\" data-has-big /></div>As Natalia Asensio, Grand Master of an ancient esoteric order, society collapses around you with the appearance of ghosts and the shattering of dimensional barriers. Trapped in a dusty basement, drugged and barely remembering your identity, you must engage in a battle of wills that could open the gates of hell. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/ccaa1b61dfc9380ba4b680c4a5bd48c8.poster.avif?t=1749390773\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/ccaa1b61dfc9380ba4b680c4a5bd48c8.webm?t=1749390773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/ccaa1b61dfc9380ba4b680c4a5bd48c8.mp4?t=1749390773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/cfe889c120a964fbd2b8cdc28e6c37d2.avif?t=1749390773\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/d099c0be13689edc1028e459e71a67d3.poster.avif?t=1749390773\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/d099c0be13689edc1028e459e71a67d3.webm?t=1749390773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/d099c0be13689edc1028e459e71a67d3.mp4?t=1749390773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tPsychological Survival Horror: Navigate intertwining physical and mental realities as you embody Natalia, a leader with deep esoteric knowledge, not a soldier. Be cautious and cunning to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tImmersive Terror: Experience terror in various forms\u2014hide in shadowy corridors, listen for footsteps, watch flickering lights, and analyze every room to stay hidden and safe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tRich Narrative: Engage with a complex and independent story, part of the expansive Radiata Saga transmedia universe, which includes books, podcasts, and more. <br>\u2022\tStunning Artistry: Enjoy meticulously crafted graphics and immersive audio designed to captivate and terrify.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tAccessible for All: Benefit from unique visual and auditory accessibility features, ensuring an enjoyable experience for everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/96811a026b3a7561674402e5f1791462.poster.avif?t=1749390773\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/96811a026b3a7561674402e5f1791462.webm?t=1749390773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/96811a026b3a7561674402e5f1791462.mp4?t=1749390773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
